celeste-linux (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial packaging: the jpackage app image with its own trimmed runtime under
    /usr/lib/celeste-linux, the application menu entry, the hicolor icon and the
    systemd user unit (installed, not enabled). The ONNX Runtime jar is cut to
    the platform this package can load, 90 MB -> 5.7 MB, and the build refuses
    to proceed if the cut has nothing to cut (PLAN.md §4, §10/M6).

